Description: Swift-native coding agent for jailbroken iOS
 kwwk's interactive coding CLI, built for iOS and installed as `kk`. Drives an
 existing Anthropic, ChatGPT (Codex), Copilot, Cursor, Kimi, Grok, Z.AI, or
 OpenRouter subscription, or a raw API key for any OpenAI-compatible endpoint.
 Run `kk` in a terminal on device and `/login` to sign in. It is also installed
 as `kwwk`, the name it calls itself by in its own help.
 .
 The agent's Bash, Read, Write, Edit, Grep, Find, and LS tools operate on the
 real filesystem, so it needs a bootstrap that provides a shell.
 .
 Packaged for both roothide and rootless bootstraps from one arm64 build; the
 architecture field says which layout this package is, not which CPU it runs
 on. Upstream is EYHN/kwwk@2ab7ea193605.
Name: kk
Author: EYHN <https://github.com/EYHN/kwwk>

